{
  "info": {
    "name": "SOTWISE — GSS → Consolidation Point do PL",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Simula o **GSS gravando o Consolidation Point** de um PL (11/11/2026, card da call de 10/11, item 6).\n\nNo SOTWISE, **Consolidation Point + City são uma etapa só** (`consolidation_point`). Sem `city`, a cidade vem do cadastro de produtos da fábrica no GSS: uma cidade → automática; várias → fica em branco (ou mande `city`); nenhuma → mantém a atual.\n\n**Antes de rodar:** preencha as variáveis `cp_pl_number` (um PL ainda em Pre-loading), `cp_factory_gss_id` (gss_id da fábrica) e, para o 2º request, `cp_city_gss_id` (gss_id da cidade). Esta pasta **não** cria dados: grava no PL informado."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{api_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "cp_pl_number", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cp_factory_gss_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cp_city_gss_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. PATCH consolidation_point — só a fábrica (City do cadastro) — 200",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/shipments/{{cp_pl_number}}/steps/consolidation_point",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "shipments", "{{cp_pl_number}}", "steps", "consolidation_point"]
        },
        "description": "Fábrica com uma cidade só: a `city` da resposta vem preenchida. Com várias cidades, vem `null` (a equipe escolhe na tela, ou use o request 2).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"consolidation_point\": \"{{cp_factory_gss_id}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('consolidation_point gravado', () => pm.expect(d.consolidation_point && d.consolidation_point.gss_id).to.eql(String(pm.variables.get('cp_factory_gss_id'))));",
              "pm.test('city presente na resposta (objeto ou null)', () => pm.expect(d).to.have.property('city'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. PATCH consolidation_point — fábrica + City — 200",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/shipments/{{cp_pl_number}}/steps/consolidation_point",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "shipments", "{{cp_pl_number}}", "steps", "consolidation_point"]
        },
        "description": "Para fábrica com 2+ cidades: manda a cidade junto. A etapa conclui (assinada como GSS Team).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"consolidation_point\": \"{{cp_factory_gss_id}}\",\n  \"city\": \"{{cp_city_gss_id}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('city gravada', () => pm.expect(d.city && d.city.gss_id).to.eql(String(pm.variables.get('cp_city_gss_id'))));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET o PL — confere Consolidation Point e City — 200",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/shipments/{{cp_pl_number}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "shipments", "{{cp_pl_number}}"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('tem consolidation_point e city', () => { pm.expect(d).to.have.property('consolidation_point'); pm.expect(d).to.have.property('city'); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. PATCH consolidation_point — gss_id inexistente — 400",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/shipments/{{cp_pl_number}}/steps/consolidation_point",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "shipments", "{{cp_pl_number}}", "steps", "consolidation_point"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"consolidation_point\": \"nao-existe\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"] }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
